2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hello!
2 CONT
2 CONT I have some information of Randi and Peders family, this is just notes, but hopefully you can use it. I am aware that some of this information already are found, but still.....
2 CONT
2 CONT Torun
2 CONT
2 CONT Anchestor forRandi Pedersdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT Gen. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT  1.  Randi Pedersdatter, født 09 mai 1845 i Guldeneie,Gran.Oppland. Daughter of "Jæger Peder Poulsen and Guri Hansdatter.  She married Peder Nielsen 1863 in Gran.  He was born Sept 6 1833 at  Lynneeie, Gran.Oppland, he was son of 
2 CONC Niels Olsen and Kjersti Pålsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Randi born May 9.1845, bapt in Gran May 25.  daughter of cotter Peder Poulsen and wife Guri Hansdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sponsorse: Walborg Pedersdatter Molden, Berthe Guldeneije, Erik Bjørgeeiet, Thor Gulden, Hans Guldeneiet.
2 CONT
2 CONT Emigration: pg 14 no. 2510 19.10.1871: (October 19th, 1871)
2 CONT
2 CONT Randi Pedersen 30 yrs, Kirsti 7 yrs, Niels 3 yrs from Gran.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rute: Lnarina(?) "Tasso" 20.10 and Gulbrand Pedersen 1/2 yrs from Gran.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1865 census, Oppenbråten under Vindorum in Gran:
2 CONT
2 CONT Peder Nielsen 26 yrs(!) b. in Gran
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnhild Pedersdatter, 21 yrs b. in Gran Kjersti Pedersdatter 2 yrs, same
2 CONT
2 CONT Emigrationprotocol no 223 pg. 228 (24.4.1871)( April 24th, 1871) Peder Nielsen Venerum, worker, 37 yrs from Gran Route Chicago with "Edda" April 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Peder came to America first in April and Randi and Kjersti came later that year  in October of 1871. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bachelor Peder Nielsen born at Lundereiet in Gran, lives at Vindorumseie, 30 yrs, son of Niels Olsen married in Gran 1863 with maiden Randi Pedersdatter Vindorumseiet, 18 yrs, daughter of av Peder Paulsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: (all children coming to the United States took on part of their fathers name, of Niels, as in Nelson.
2 CONT
2 CONT  i. KIRSTI4 PEDERSDATTER, b. Feb 1, 1864, Vennolumseie,Gran.Oppland; married NIELS LARSEN (Larson), emigr. to US.
2 CONT
2 CONT  ii. GUDBRAND D.E. PEDERSEN, b. Oct 17, 1866, Vennolumseie,Gran.Oppland; d. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 10 sep 1867, at Vennolumseie.
2 CONT
2 CONT  iii. NIELS PEDERSEN, b. Dec 28 des 1868, Vennolumseie.
2 CONT
2 CONT  iv. GUDBRAND PEDERSEN, b. abt. 1871; m. SOFIA /US.
2 CONT
2 CONT  v. PETRINE PEDERSDATTER.
2 CONT
2 CONT  vi. EMIL PEDERSEN.
2 CONT
2 CONT  vii. EMMA PEDERSDATTER, m. THOMAS PETERSON/US.
2 CONT
2 CONT  viii. INGEBORG PEDERSDATTER, m. JOHN NELSON/US.
2 CONT
2 CONT  ix. OLINE PEDERSDATTER.
2 CONT
2 CONT  x. HENRY D.E. PEDERSEN.
2 CONT
2 CONT  xi. HENRY PEDERSEN, m. ELISE JACQUET/Us.
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation no. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT  2.  "Jæger" Peder Poulsen, b. Aug. 29 1809 at Guldeneie,Gran.Oppland. Son of Povel Olsen and Eli Handatter.  He married maiden Guri Hansdatter Dec. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT 1833 in Gran.Oppland.
2 CONT
2 CONT  3.  "Maiden" Guri Hansdatter, b. Nov. 10 1814 at Bjørgeeie,Gran.Oppland; died July 13, 1845 at Guldeneie,Gran, daughter of Hans Guttormsen and Kari Paalsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT   i. Elie Pedersdatter, b. Jan 9, 1834 at Bjørgeeie,Gran.Oppland. Died in the US; married Haaken Nielsen
2 CONT
2 CONT 1863 in Gran.Oppland, dien in the US.
2 CONT
2 CONT    ii. Kari Pedersdatter, b Jun 27, 1836 at Guldeneie,Gran.Oppland; died after 1873 in US; married Halvor
2 CONT
2 CONT Larsen; died aft. 1871 in the US.
2 CONT
2 CONT   iii. Paul Pedersen, b Mar 31, 1840 at Guldeneie,Gran.Oppland; died 1841 in Guldeneie,Gran.
2 CONT
2 CONT   iv. Hans Pedersen, b Sept 3, 1842 at Guldeneie,Gran.Oppland; died aft. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1869 in the US; married widdow
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Nielsdatter 1867 in Gran.
2 CONT
2 CONT   v. Randi Pedersdatter, født 09 mai 1845 i Guldeneie,Gran.Oppland; married Peder Nielsen 1863 in Gran.
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation no. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT  4.  Povel Olsen  married Eli Handatter 1798 in Gran.Oppland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  2 i. "Jæger" Peder Poulsen, b Aug 29, 1809 at Guldenieie,Gran.Oppland; married "Maiden" Guri Hansdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT Dec 3, 1833 in Gran.Oppland; married (2) Kari Andersdatter 1845 in Gran.Oppland; married (3) Maren Olsdatter 1853 in Gran.Oppland.
2 CONT
2 CONT  6.  Hans Guttormsen  married 7.  Kari Paalsdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  3 i. Guri Hansdatter, b. Nov 10 1814 at Bjørgeeie,Gran.Oppland; died July
2 CONT
2 CONT 13 1845 at
2 CONT
2 CONT Guldeneie,Gran.Oppland; m. Peder Poulsen.
2 CONT
2 CONT For sure more children here!
2 CONT
