1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lenferd Melvin Peterson Memorial Photos Flowers Edit Share Learn about removing the ads from this memorial... Birth: 	Oct. 24, 1906 Ossian Winneshiek County Iowa, USA Death: 	Jul. 12, 1990 West Union Fayette County
2 CONC  Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Melvin Peterson, son of Chris and Mary (Severson) Peterson, was born Oct 24,1906 at Ossian, Iowa. On July 24,1937, he was united in marriage to Edna Hilgerson at St. Olaf Lutheran Church, West Union, Iowa and to this union were bo
2 CONC rn two children. Lenferd lived in the West Union area most of his life except for a short period in Canada as a child. Lenferd died Thursday July 12,1990, at the Palmer Lutheran Health Center in West Union at the age of 83. Servic
2 CONC es were held Saturday July 14,1990 at the St Olaf Lutheran Church with Rev Roger McKinstry officiating with burial in Gods Acres Cemetery, Clermont Iowa 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Edna Hilgerson Peterson (1915 - 2008)
2 CONT
