1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.helgeland.nu/english/genealogy/Other/Stavanger/joergine_svela.htm#i10211
2 CONT  Torger Torgerson, son of Torger Olson and Guri Mauritsdotter, was born in 1723 in Solberg, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 21. Nov 1723 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1792 in Sagland, Bjerkreim
2 CONC , Rogaland, NOR at age 69, and was buried on 22. Jan 1792 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Torger was Torgier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Torger married Berete Larsdotter on 24. Jun 1746 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Noted events in their marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • They published an intent to marry Kongebrev. Søskenbarn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 17 i. Jorunn Torgersdotter. Jorunn married Torger Einarson, son of Einar Nilsson and Ågot Torgersdotter, on 20. May 1770 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. They had no children. Jorunn next married Peder Pedersen Egela
2 CONC nd, son of Peder Pederson and Siri Olsdotter, on 26. Mar 1775 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Guri Torgersdotter was born in 1751 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 7. Nov 1751 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1775 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 24, and was buried
2 CONC  on 1. Oct 1775 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Guri married Ole Torsteinson d. e., son of Torstein Olson and Astrid Nilsdotter, on 2. Jun 1771 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Ambjørg Torgersdotter was born in 1754 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 14. Jul 1754 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Ambjørg was Ambjør.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Lars Torgerson was born in 1760 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 15. Jun 1760 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1765 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 5, and was buried on 
2 CONC 14. Oct 1765 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. Torger Torgerson was born in 1763 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 13. Mar 1763 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, and died on 12. Mar 1840 in Kløgetvedt, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 77. A
2 CONC nother name for Torger was Torgier. Torger married Ingeborg Larsdotter, daughter of Lars Omundson and Guri Torgersdotter, on 13. Jun 1784 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. Lars Torgerson was born in 1769 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 4. Jun 1769 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1797 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 28, and was buried on 
2 CONC 30. Nov 1797 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. Lars married Marta Pedersdotter, daughter of Peder Larsson and Valborg Torgersdotter, on 11. Jun 1792 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Torger next married Gunhild Gulliksdotter, daughter of Gullik Torsteinson and Marete Larsdotter, on 17. Apr 1789 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT The child from this marriage was:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Berit Torgersdotter was born in 1790 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 4. Jun 1790 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1792 in Sagland, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 2, and was buried 
2 CONC on 5. Apr 1792 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. 
