2 CONT
2 CONT Ane Sofie Vestly married 11 Apr 1867 med Ivar Braut Rimestad (July 23, 1838-May 27, 1898), the son of Lars Larsson Braut and Margrete Toresdtr. Orre.  Ivar = bonde på Rimestad i Nærbo.   They had 7 children: 
