2 CONT # Søren Iversen (1870) 
2 CONT # Gabriel Rimestad (1873-1883) 
2 CONT # Iver Iverson (1875).  Same as the Iver Iverson b. 1883-d. 1967 buried in Cavalier Co., North Dakota?:  http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=52919820
2 CONT # Margreta Rimestad 
2 CONT # Martin Rimestad (1881) 
2 CONT # Gilbert Iverson (born as Gabriel Rimestad on Jan. 9, 1885-d. June 5, 1965 in  [https://www.google.com/maps/place/Storlie,+ND/@48.3338951,-98.2433712,9z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x52c344f21d694ea5:0x8436c1b2aac3be2e '''Hampden, N. Dakota'
2 CONC '']).  Gilbert appears in the [https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:33S7-9RJF-D5C?i=5&wc=QZZ7-S89%3A133637201%2C134614401%2C134708401%2C1589089095%3Fcc%3D1727033&cc=1727033 '''1910'''] U.S. census for Cavalier County, North Dak
2 CONC ota (near Hampden), working on the farm of brother Søren (Sam). Gilbert married Ingeborg Hognestad. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Source: ''Aasland-Aetten'', 1762-1979.)
