1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gabriel was [http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:kb_read?idx_kildeid=1632&uid=ny&idx_side=-88 born] Oct. 6, 1849 in Lye Praestergjeld / Time Sogn, Rogaland.  Farm was [https://www.google.co.in/maps/@58.7297216,5.7125181,
2 CONC 970m/data=!3m1!1e3?hl=en '''Vestlye'''] (which is in the ''west''ern part of [https://maps.google.com/maps?q=map+Vestly,+Time,+Rogaland&ll=58.712348,5.704908&spn=0.026076,0.102482&hq=Vestly,+Time,+Rogaland&t=m&z=14 ''Lye'']), sout
2 CONC h of Stavanger.  Gabriel [http://www.arkivverket.no/URN:kb_read?idx_kildeid=3629&uid=ny&idx_side=-181 died] on Sept. 15, 1912 in Stavanger.  His [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/8071e1fafeb67aca917da0ac04557368 obituary] was published o
2 CONC n page 1 of ''Stavanger Aftenblad'' on Sept. 16, 1912.  [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/cdafedd1db1c5be2056c749eb00db474?index=3 Death notice] appeared Sept. 19, 1912 in ''Stavanger Aftenblad'', p. 7.  (See in MEDIA)
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1900 census (below) Gabriel is "independent businessman," and four of his children work in "boutik" (son Levard was later a Master Tailor).
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father Søren Sørensen Bråstein (whose father was Søren Olssen Bråstein of Høiland, also in Time Sogn)
2 CONT * Mother Gertrud Christophersdtr Aasland (also in Time Sogn). They were married June 19, 1836.
2 CONT
2 CONT Farm Numbers and Names as listed in ''Rygg's Norwegian Farm Names'' about 1900 include 31 Aasland 35 Høiland  22 Vestly ([https://familysearch.org/wiki/en/Time_(Lye),_Norway FamilySearch.org]).
2 CONT
