2 CONT In [http://www.rhd.uit.no/folketellinger/ftliste_e.aspx?ft=1875&knr=1103&kenr=007&bnr=0016&lnr=00 Census year 1875], Father Søren Sørensen Bråstein had just died.  Gabriel (26) was living with older brother Svend in Stavanger:
