1 NAME Niels Birkrem /Sørensen/
2 GIVN Niels Birkrem
2 _MARNM Sørensen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 MAR 1890
2 PLAC Stavanger
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
