2 CONT
2 CONT Berete Larsdotter, daughter of Lars Olson and Jorunn Gunnarsdotter, was born in 1725 in Røysland søre, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 18. Nov 1725 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1783 in Sagland
2 CONC , Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR at age 58, and was buried on 24. Aug 1783 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Berete married Tomas Olson, son of Ole Tomasson and Kirsti Rasmusdotter, on 28. May 1745 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Berete next married Torger Torgerson on 24. Jun 1746 in Bjerkreim kyrkje, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR
