2 CONT Ole Friestad married Gunhild Olina (Lena) Westly on February 10, 1908 in Kermit, Divide Co., ND. Ole listed as son of Johannes Pedersen and Gesine Rasmusdatter; Lena listed as daughter of Soren Sorensen and Josine Gabrielsdatter. 
2 CONC  He was listed as born in "Klep, Stavanger, Norge"; she was listed as born in "Time, Stavanger, Norge." [ U.S., Evangelical Lutheran Church of America, Records, 1875-1940]
2 CONT
2 CONT The US Census of 1910 shows her name as "Lena Friestad": https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/MLGC-7JR
