1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In ''Stavanger Aftenblad'', on a rowing team, [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/ca6560e776b98d1a600ce1ac23e324f1?index=52 Jan. 31, 1911],  [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/5662c0826290bf569850e23cd30624bb?index=72 Oct. 1, 1912]
2 CONC , and in [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/30de3c1dd2a55ee1166f7fe6edcecc07?index=154 Oct. 2, 1913] with older brother Gunleif.  Re-elected as an officer of the rowing team, [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/deb6bf007441ed544d91601c94afe230?ind
2 CONC ex=166 Jan. 19, 1914].
2 CONT
2 CONT Einar was a member & officer in Stavanger Teetotallers' Youth Association whose name appeared often in the newspaper: [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/113baae0d6ae2a03f0890807f01419de?index=2 1911], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/c02753673a
2 CONC f42afdcc1f36ca47df6307?index=53 1911], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/cb6736fdba90572dc5b2849939eb4542?index=5 1912], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/3d63a5222a4102dabdd2a5331731d6ff?index=60 1912], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/e5c45ea9ee0d9
2 CONC 95373f8655f5fa7fe5f?index=61 1912], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/609a982f2bf457161bf1e43a657d788f?index=1 1913], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/79aaed71719e954ca62ec16aea37bae2?index=10 1914], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/c351d30a8128c431
2 CONC b3adf716e9015add?index=178 1915], [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/4099c827bf35cef049ea0881db5c36a4?index=183 1915], among others.
2 CONT
2 CONT Registered a company for stock-trading, [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/d4199b1d88abd9effe6e9d790cff7fc9?index=173 March 29, 1915].
2 CONT
2 CONT In wedding records for ''Stavanger Domkirken'', April 12, 1917 (SAST, Domkirken sokneprestkontor, A/L0016: Ministerialbok nr. A 33, 1905-1922, s. 120, Bilde 124,196 (Viede 1917) at [https://media.digitalarkivet.no/view/1793/124 ''
2 CONC 'Digitalarkivet.no''']:
2 CONT * Einar Westly, ''kontorist''.  Says b. 1893.
2 CONT * Anna Jeremiassen, ''boutikdame'', b. 1891.  Her father was Jeremias E. J. Jeremiassen.  Best men were Edvard Westly and Olaf Henriksen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Einar was taken into the firm of Johan Olsen in [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/b2b2b279b8b8c6297bebb53c94a885cf?index=7 1917].
2 CONT
2 CONT Interviewed about his work as a manager with the company Øgried og Sønner, of Høianger, [http://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/72c8f02776f657f94f48c11cbf449d19?index=202 Dec. 27, 1916].  Knud Øgried of that firm was an architect and Einar's b
2 CONC rother-in-law.
2 CONT
2 CONT Leader (1953-58) in Rogaland's [https://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rogaland_Venstre Liberal] county organization (?).  Einar died in 1959.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://media.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070105320665 Baptism record] - "Einar", son of Gabriel Sørensen Westly, born 29 Jan 1893, baptised 5 March 1893 - Domkirken, Stavanger
