1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Baptised Karl Johan Sörensen Westly on February 14, 1892, in Stavanger, Rogaland, Norway. Father: Sven Sörensen Westly; Mother: Olufine Gjertine Eriksdatter. [Norway, Select Baptisms, 1634-1927, ancestry.com]
2 CONT
2 CONT Immigrated March 9, 1910 from Norway to New York and lived in 1910 with sister Gertrude Helgesen in Brooklyn.  Lived in Los Angeles from 1915 until at least 1933. In 1933 resided at 339 1/2  S. Hill St., Los Angeles.
2 CONT
2 CONT Declared for permanent residence May 8, 1933 in Los Angeles, CA. Unmarried at this point. [California District Court (Roll 192) Petitions for Naturalization 47507-47925; 8/6/35-9/9/35]
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived 1942: 155 Bimini Place, Los Angeles [WW II draft registration]
