1 NOTE {geni:about_me} WEST LANE NEWS, Veneta, Lane County Oregon, November 30, Arline Poole Cox 
2 CONT
2 CONT HENRY WILLIAM ASHLAND Graveside services were held for Henry Ashland, Walton, on November 24, 1972 with Reverend Lester Allison of the Springfield Church of the Valley officiating at Rest Haven Memorial Park.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Ashland was born Feb. 25, 1904 in Cooperstown, North Dakota and passed away on Nov. 19, 1972 at the age of 68. He had been a resident of the area for many years.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by a sister, Mrs. Dora Lier of Valley City, North Dakota; five brothers, Jens Ashland of Cooperstown, Oscar of Hannaford, North Dakota, Albert Ashland of Veneta, Roy Ashland of Hillsboro, North Dakota and Walter Ash
2 CONC land of Eugene.
2 CONT
2 CONT For those who wish, contributions may be made in his memory to the Fern Ridge Community Library Fund in care of Poole-Larsen Chapel.
2 CONT --------------------
