2 CONC 1965) who married William Holm (1891-1983); Eleanore Margaret Jensen (1897-1987) who married Mahlon Edward Shanahan (1900-1993); and the youngest was Alvin Jensen (1899-1986) who married Helen Mae Baldwin (1907-1998).
2 CONT
2 CONT First Marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married Albert Rath (1881-1950) and had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
