1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thea Jensen (1885-1910) was both deaf and mute. (b. March 10, 1885, Chicago, Cook County, Illinois, USA - d. October 15, 1910, Chicago, Cook County, Illinois, USA)
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:
2 CONT
2 CONT Thea was the daughter of Lena Elaine Olson (1860-1938) aka Hannah Eline Olsdatter; and Andrew Havig Jensen (1861-1930). She was named after her maternal grandmother. Thea was both deaf and mute.
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT Her siblings include: Mary Jensen (1883-1969) aka Marie Jensen, who was married to Albert Rath (1881-1950) and later married Nels Hemwall (1875-1965); Leif Jensen (1886-1955) who was a stockbroker that married Agnes Hansen (1890-1
2 CONC 965); Leonard G. Jensen I (1887-1979) who married Gertrude Brock (1892-1944); Josetta Dorothy Jensen (1889-1940) aka Dolly Jensen, who married William James Gogerty (1893-1939); Margarite Jensen (1891-1986) aka Daisy Jensen, who m
2 CONC arried Francis Joseph Woods (1891-1972) aka Frank Wooods, and later married Robert Campbell; Goldie Jensen (1891-1965) who married William Holm (1891-1983); Eleanore Margaret Jensen (1897-1987) who married Mahlon Edward Shanahan (
2 CONC 1900-1993); and the youngest was Alvin Jensen (1900-1986) who married Helen Mae Baldwin (1907-1998).
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT Thea married Max Caro (1882-c1920) who was Jewish. Max may have died in the influenza pandemic of 1918 or he may have died in 1920 and be the Max Caro listed in the Illinois Death Index for that year.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Max and Thea had the following children: Grace Lillie Caro (1902-1994) who married Frank Cruicshank Failing (1901-1948) then after his death she married Carl J. Taylor (1901-1967); Ira Caro (1905-1975) who married Josephine Slatte
2 CONC ry (1915-1955); Harold L. Caro (1907-1998) who married Mary Virgilous Geary (1918- ); Ann Caro (1910-1968) who married Sye X and after his death married Carl Munter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:
2 CONT
2 CONT Thea died on October 15, 1910 less than a month after giving birth to her daughter, Anna. Her Illinois Death Certificate Number was "2277". Mary Virgilous Geary (1918- ) believes the cause of death was complications from a gallsto
2 CONC ne operation. Thea and Max's children were then raised by Lena and Andrew Jensen, and they appear at 4932 Austin Avenue in Chicago on the 1920 US census.
2 CONT
2 CONT Relationship:
2 CONT
2 CONT Thea Jensen (1885-1910) was the first cousin, twice removed of Richard Arthur Norton (1958- ). 
