1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daisy Jensen (1891-1986) was a a hairdresser and later a housewife. (b. August 27, 1892, Chicago, Cook County, Illinois, USA - d. August 06, 1986, River Forest, Cook County, Illinois, 60305, USA) Social Security Nu
2 CONC mber 265412992. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name:
2 CONT She was born as "Olijette Jensen" but went by the name "Daisy Jensen". In one document she used "Margaret Jensen". She died under the name "Daisy Woods"
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:
2 CONT She was the daughter of Andrew Havig Jensen (1861-1930) and Lena Elaine Olsen (1860-1938) aka Hannah Eline Olsdatter. Daisy had the following siblings: Mary Jensen (1883-1969) aka Marie Jensen, who was married to Albert Rath (1881
2 CONC -1950) and she later married Nels Hemwall (1875-1965); Thea Jensen (1885-1910) who married Max Caro (1882-1918); Leif Jensen (1886-1955) who married Agnes Hansen (1890-1965); Leonard G. Jensen I (1887-1979) who married Gertrude Br
2 CONC ock (1892-1944); Josetta Dorothy Jensen (1889-1940) aka Dolly Jensen, who married William James Gogerty (1893-1939); Goldie Jensen (1893-1965) who married William Holm (1891-1983); Eleanore Margaret Jensen (1897-1987) who married 
2 CONC Mahlon Edward Shanahan (1900-1993); and the youngest was Alvin Jensen (1900-1986) who married Helen Mae Baldwin (1907-1998). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hairdresser:
2 CONT In the 1917 Chicago City Directory Daisy was listed as working as an hairdresser and living at 4940 West Austin Avenue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage:
2 CONT She married Francis Woods (1891-1972) aka Frank Woods, in 1918. Frank worked in advertising. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child:
2 CONT Together they had a single child: Sheila Mary Woods (1932-1990) who married Robert H. Campbell. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Chicago:
2 CONT Daisy and Frank appear in the 1920 US Census living at 4940 Austin Avenue in Chicago with Leif Jensen as the head of household, and Frank working as a clerk at an advertising company. In 1930 they are living in their own house and
2 CONC  Frank was now a Vice President at an advertising company.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:
2 CONT She died under the name "Daisy Woods" on August 06, 1986 in River Forest, Cook County, Illinois. She was buried in Calvary Cemetery. 
