1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Theodora Winblad (1888) Died as Infant (b. 1888, 165 Christopher Street, Greenwich Village, Manhattan, New York County, New York City, New York, USA - d. August 04, 1888, 165 Christopher Street, Greenwich Village, 
2 CONC Manhattan, New York County, New York City, New York, USA)
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodora was the second child born to John Edward Winblad (1856-1914) and Salmine Sophia Severine Pedersen (1861-1914). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT The other siblings are: Anton (Tony) Julius Winblad (1886-1975) born on April 05, 1886 who married Eva Ariel Lattin (1892-1939) on April 17, 1910 and who after her death married Marguerite (Marge) Van Rensselaer Schuyler (1891-197
2 CONC 2) in 1939; Mary Winblad (1889) who died of infantile colic; Otto Edward Winblad (1892) who died as an infant of acute bronchitis; Marie (Mae) Elizabeth Winblad (1895-1987) born on February 16, 1895 who married Arthur Oscar Freude
2 CONC nberg (1891-1968) on February 28, 1914; John (Eddie) Edward Winblad II (1897-1899) who died at 2 years old of bronchiopneumonia; and Otto Perry Winblad (1902-1977) born on August 05, 1902 who married Helen Louise Hollenbach (1905-
2 CONC 1928) on October 09, 1926 and who after her death married Leah Maria Way (1901-1986) on June 05, 1933. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodora died in 1888 of meningitis and was buried in Evergreen Cemetery with her sister Mary and brother Otto Edward Winblad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Relationship:
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodora Winblad (1888) was the grandaunt of Richard Arthur Norton (1958- ). 
