1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Otto Edward Winblad (1892) Died as Infant (b. August 19, 1892, 447 Washington Street, Manhattan, New York City, New York County, New York, 10013-1723, USA - d. December 08, 1892, 447 Washington Street, Manhattan, N
2 CONC ew York City, New York County, New York, 10013-1723, USA) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward was born in 1892 to John Edward Winblad (1856-1914) of Sweden and Salmine Sophia Severine Pedersen (1861-1914) of Norway. The New York City Birth Index lists him as "Otto E. Winbled" with certificate "32258".
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT His siblings include: Anton Julius Winblad (1886-1975) aka Tony Winblad, who married Eva Ariel Lattin (1892-1939) and after her death married Marguerite Van Rensselaer Schuyler (1891-1972) aka Marge Lattin; Theodora Winblad (1888)
2 CONC  who died as an infant; Mary Winblad (1889) who died as an infant; Marie Elizabeth Winblad (1895-1987) aka Mae Winblad, who married Arthur Oscar Freudenberg (1891-1968); John Edward Winblad II (1897-1899) aka Eddie Winblad; and Ot
2 CONC to Perry Winblad (1902-1977) who married Helen Louise Hollenbach (1905-1928) and after her death married Leah Maria Way (1901-1986). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto Edward Winblad died in 1892 of "acute bronchitis". The New York City Death Index listed him as "Otto E. Winbled" which was transcribed as "Otto B. Winbled" in the electronic index. His certificate was number "42084". 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial:
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in Evergreen Cemetery at 1629 Bushwick Avenue in Brooklyn in New York with his infant sisters: Theodora Winblad and Mary Winblad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Relationship:
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto Edward Winblad (1892) was the granduncle of Richard Arthur Norton (1958- ).
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT Researched and written by Richard Arthur Norton (1958- ) for Findagrave starting on July 10, 2003.
