2 CONT Knut Andreas Knutson married Anna Gurina Axelsdatter in Norway. He immigrated to the U.S. from Norway in 1890 with his four children, Carl Aleksander Knutson, Laura Helena Knutson (Mrs. Nelson), Gustav Albert Knutson, and Lillie O
2 CONC rine Knutson (Mrs. Harestad). The family lived in Garden City, Hardin county, Iowa, where Knut was employed at the elevator.
